Reproduce: download archive inside the repository, extract, and rename
lwip-STABLE-2_2_1_RELEASE to third_party/lwip. Build only src/core/*.c,
src/core/ipv4/*.c, src/netif/ethernet.c with include/lwip-port and
third_party/lwip/src/include on the include path. No host installation.
RebaneOS config uses NO_SYS and static 10.0.2.15/24 via 10.0.2.2 for QEMU
user networking. Guest libc resolves names through UDP to 10.0.2.3.
